WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.901
Systems as a sound recordist. Every channel you bring goes on the invoice.

2
00:00:07.151 --> 00:00:12.901
Your package is priced by the channel: radio mics, booms and timecode.

3
00:00:13.151 --> 00:00:19.301
Your radio mic licence is shared across the jobs you used it on.

4
00:00:19.551 --> 00:00:26.903
Pencils and drops are kept on record, with the cancellation invoice drafted where the terms allow.

5
00:00:27.153 --> 00:00:35.304
And your sound package keeps the whole kit list, priced by the day.

